WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:10.247
Rosie is my pet goose.

2
00:00:10.248 --> 00:00:18.795
Rosie and I do chores together.

3
00:00:18.796 --> 00:00:22.976
I set the table.

4
00:00:22.977 --> 00:00:37.117
Rosie folds the napkins.

5
00:00:37.118 --> 00:00:43.438
I dig the hole.

6
00:00:43.439 --> 00:00:49.248
Rosie plants the seeds.

7
00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:53.053
I rake the leaves.

8
00:00:53.054 --> 00:00:59.526
Rosie waters the flowers.

9
00:00:59.527 --> 00:01:04.155
I vacuum the rug.

10
00:01:04.156 --> 00:01:10.602
Rosie sweeps the floor.

11
00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:15.429
I scrub the sink.

12
00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:21.301
Rosie wipes the windows.

13
00:01:21.302 --> 00:01:27.166
Whew. We're tired.

14
00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:30.977
We need to rest.

15
00:01:30.978 --> 00:01:34.447
I take a nap.

16
00:01:34.448 --> 00:01:44.315
Rosie takes a nap too.

